  <para style="q1"><char style="w" strong="H3588" x-morph="Conj" x-position="14" x-lemma="כִּֽי־" x-translit="kî-">although</char> <char style="w" strong="H2851" x-morph="N-fsc | 3mp" x-position="16" x-lemma="חִתִּיתָ֜ם" x-translit="ḥit·tî·ṯām">their terror</char> <char style="w" strong="H5414" x-morph="V-Nifal-Perf-3ms" x-position="15" x-lemma="נִתַּ֨ן" x-translit="nit·tan">was once spread</char></para>
